/*---------------------------------------------------------------------------*\
  Benchmark E (developer-facing; benchmarks/README.md): the reference
  simulator's "Hydrogen production through Methane Catalytic Steam
  Reforming" sample -- ONE isothermal plug-flow reactor at 1000 K and 1 atm,
  1 m3, on Xu & Froment's (1989) three-reaction intrinsic kinetics --
  reproduced as a Choupo case on PR78 with E-PPR78 kij at the bed's declared
  temperature, the three rates written in constant/reactions with every
  parameter cited, and the equilibrium constants the article does not print
  taken from Choupo's own formation data (system/propsDict, reactionGibbs).
  See README and `reference`.
\*---------------------------------------------------------------------------*/

application   choupoSolve;
description   "Benchmark E: methane steam reforming in an isothermal PFR at 1000 K, 1 atm -- Xu & Froment 1989 kinetics, PR78 + E-PPR78 kij at 1000 K";

verbosity     2;
